OL,3,GNEWSAMan 'lured' underage girl to
OL,4,Ahotels for sex
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who groomed and lured an underage
OL,7,Fgirl to a hotel in Doncaster to have
OL,8,Fsex with her has been jailed for nine
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FMartin Norton, 32, of no fixed address,
OL,12,Fhas been sentenced for his "abhorrent"
OL,13,Fcrimes in 2025 for engaging in sexual
OL,14,Factivity with a girl under the age of
OL,15,F15.
OL,17,FNorton was arrested in a hotel room in
OL,18,FNovember 2025 after police officers
OL,19,Fresponded to reports and concerns he
OL,20,Fhad enticed a young girl and was
OL,21,Ftravelling from Newcastle, taking her
OL,22,Fto hotels for sex.
