OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers found Norton started talking
OL,7,Fto the girl on social media before
OL,8,Fasking her for provocative images and
OL,9,Feventually grooming her into believing
OL,10,Fhe was her boyfriend, South Yorkshire
OL,11,FPolice said.
